Subject: Creating a concordance data frame by filtering out the observations and meta information from an HTML-coded COHA concordance file
Message-ID: <hztqQhPyMac.nIDJhIC9BAAJ@corpling-with-r.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/corpling-with-r/c/hztqQhPyMac/m/nIDJhIC9BAAJ>
